        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T21:01:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: this isn\u0027t an override of XmlConverter::init(), because the latter is private. And an overriding would have to be marked with \u0027override\u0027 to work. However, a virtual method shouldn\u0027t be called from the constructor. I find this design of classes is a bit confusing. Can we make it more clear?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 42,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "b62cf4a993454ca0e4d6f6e710ed0ad7762a7446",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b148edc1_aeff0a76",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/include/core-impl/EngineConfigXmlConverter.h",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 42,
      "author": {
        "id": 1945984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T22:11:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, this isn\u0027t supposed to be an override. \n\nThe virtual init() in XmlConverter.h is something I forgot to delete when fixing patchset 5, which I realized wouldn\u0027t work, but then didn\u0027t clean up completely. Sorry about that, and thank you for catching it!",
      "parentUuid": "ca341ba9_cf4a501f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 42,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "b62cf4a993454ca0e4d6f6e710ed0ad7762a7446",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d701dd1b_2a698685",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/include/core-impl/XmlConverter.h",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 41,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T21:01:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, assuming that you actually need a virtual \u0027init\u0027 method (see my comment on it below), you indeed need to declare a virtual destructor. In this case, prefer to use `\u003d default` instead of `{}`, see go/totw/131.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "b62cf4a993454ca0e4d6f6e710ed0ad7762a7446",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cbec0b72_348f663a",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/include/core-impl/XmlConverter.h",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 41,
      "author": {
        "id": 1945984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T22:11:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Virtual init method and destructor not needed.",
      "parentUuid": "d701dd1b_2a698685",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "b62cf4a993454ca0e4d6f6e710ed0ad7762a7446",
